stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT : User creates goal
    DRAFT --> ACTIVE : User activates
    ACTIVE --> PAUSED : User pauses
    PAUSED --> ACTIVE : User resumes
    ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : Target value reached
    ACTIVE --> FAILED : Deadline passed
    COMPLETED --> ARCHIVED : After 30 days auto-archive
    FAILED --> ARCHIVED : After 30 days auto-archive
    ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : User cancels
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    ARCHIVED --> [*]

    note right of ACTIVE
        Progress updated on:
        - New tracker entry
        - Platform sync
        - Manual update
    end note

    note right of COMPLETED
        Triggers:
        - Achievement check
        - +100 points reward
        - Completion notification
    end note
